        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the issue!\n\nYes, I can reproduce.\n\n> Not sure if this is an issue on SourceHut's end or mini.deps'. Please do correct me if it's the former.\n\nIt is kind of both:\n- 'mini.deps' uses `--filter=blob:none` for a more compact repo size and faster initial download.\n- SourceHut server's don't support filtering on its servers, at least by default. If users can configure their own servers, then there needs to be something like `git config --global uploadpack.allowFilter true` executed there.\n\nClosing as not really an issue with 'mini.deps', as core functionality works as expected and warnings can/should be removed by updating upstream servers.",
